          "id": "take_break_001_01",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "休憩しよう。これは逃げじゃなくて、ちゃんと整える時間。",
          "displayText": "Let us take a break. This is not running away; it is time to reset properly.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "take_break_001_02",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "gentle",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "take_break_001_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "水を飲んで、画面から少しだけ目を離して。私、ここで待ってるから。",
          "displayText": "Drink some water and look away from the screen for a little. I will wait here.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
          "nextId": "take_break_001_03",
          "presentation": {
            "expression": "warm",
            "animation": ""
          },
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "take_break_001_03",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "戻る時のために、次に開く場所だけメモしておくと安心だよ。",
          "displayText": "For when you return, it helps to note the next place to open.",
          "language": "japanese",
          "voice": "alterra",
          "audioKey": "",
